{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 7560,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We hold these truths to be self-evident \nthat all men are created equal that they  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12080,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are endowed by the creator with \ncertain unalienable rights that  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15760,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "among these are life liberty \nand the pursuit of happiness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21935,
    "dDurationMs": 4705,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To molest any person, Jew or Gentile, \nfor either professing Doctrine is to  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26640,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "persecute him and such a person whether his \nDoctrine or practice be true or false suffers  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32160,
    "dDurationMs": 9320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "persecution for conscience. Now in view of this entire disfranchisement of one-half the  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41480,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people of this country and because women \ndo feel themselves aggrieved, oppressed,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46200,
    "dDurationMs": 5080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and fraudulently deprived of their most sacred \nrights we insist that they have immediate  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51280,
    "dDurationMs": 8063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "admission to all the rights and privileges \nwhich belong to them as citizens of these United States."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59343,
    "dDurationMs": 4577,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are the great principles of political \nfreedom and of natural Justice embodied in that  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63920,
    "dDurationMs": 8512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Declaration of Independence extended to us? \nWhat to the American slave is your fourth of July?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72432,
    "dDurationMs": 5448,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, we have fought for America with all her \nimperfections. Not so much for what she is but for  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77880,
    "dDurationMs": 8240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what we know she can be. The Negro has been here \nin America since 1619, a total of 344 years. He's  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86120,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not going anywhere else. This country is his home. \nHe wants to do his part to help make his city,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92160,
    "dDurationMs": 6803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "state, and nation a better place for everyone, \nregardless of color and race. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99041,
    "dDurationMs": 5679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I still have a dream, a dream deeply rooted in the American \ndream. One day this nation will rise up and  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104720,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "live out the true meaning of its Creed. We hold \nthese truths to be self-evident that all men are created equal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112954,
    "dDurationMs": 4286,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have talked long enough in this \ncountry about equal rights. We have talked for 100  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117240,
    "dDurationMs": 5899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "years or more. It is time now to so write the \nnext chapter and write it in the books of law."
    } ]
  } ]
}
